	<#f4cf72>SUPER L</>
	<#aab8c7>Moves & Controls</>

<#72c8eb>BUTTONS</>
Light Punch		^X
Medium Punch		^Y
Heavy Punch		^Z
Light Kick		^A
Medium Kick		^B
Heavy Kick		^C
<#aab8c7>Directions are relative to your opponent.</>
<#aab8c7>A plus sign means simultaneous input.</>

<#72c8eb>MOVEMENT & DEFENSE</>
Forward Dash		_F_F
Back Dash		_B_B
Super Jump		_D_U
Double Jump		_U
<#aab8c7>Press Up again high enough during a jump.</>
Quick Stand		_D
<#aab8c7>Press Down as you hit the ground.</>
High / Air Parry		_F
Low Parry		_D
<#aab8c7>Tap the direction just before the attack hits.</>
Personal Action		^Z_+^C

<#72c8eb>THROWS & UNIQUE ATTACKS</>
Ground Throw		^X_+^A
Forward Throw		_F_+^X_+^A
Back Throw		_B_+^X_+^A
<#aab8c7>Close range against a grounded opponent.</>
Air Throw		^X_+^A
<#aab8c7>Close range; both characters airborne.</>
Forward Palm		_F_+^Y
Leap Attack		^Y_+^B
Light Kick > Medium Kick		^A > ^B
<#aab8c7>Follow the far standing Light Kick.</>
Close Medium Punch > Super Jump		^Y > _D_U
<#aab8c7>Perform the jump during the close punch.</>

<#72c8eb>EX MOVES — HOW TO USE</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves are powered-up versions of certain specials.</>
<#aab8c7>Use the normal motion, then press two buttons together.</>
Two Punch buttons		[^X_+^Y/^Y_+^Z/^X_+^Z]
Two Kick buttons		[^A_+^B/^B_+^C/^A_+^C]
<#aab8c7>Use the button type required by that move.</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves spend power; build meter before using them.</>
<#aab8c7>EX specials require 400 power.</>
<#aab8c7>Fireball / Uppercut use Punches; Hitobashira uses Kicks.</>
<#aab8c7>Charge Back or Down for about 0.7 seconds.</>
<#aab8c7>EX Super Arts have separate costs listed below.</>

<#72c8eb>SPECIAL MOVES</>
Charge Fireball <#aab8c7>[EX]</>		_B (hold) _F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Rising Uppercut <#aab8c7>[EX]</>		_D (hold) _U_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Niouriki (Command Throw)		_F_D_B_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Hitobashira <#aab8c7>[EX]</>		_D_DF_F_+[^A/^B/^C]
Air Hitobashira <#aab8c7>[EX]</>		_D_DF_F_+[^A/^B/^C]
<#aab8c7>Air Hitobashira: perform during a jump.</>

<#72c8eb>SUPER ART SELECTION</>
Change Super Art during intro		_U / _D
Confirm selection		[^X/^Y/^Z/^A/^B/^C]
<#aab8c7>Choose I, II or III before the round begins.</>
<#aab8c7>All three arts below use the same motion;</>
<#aab8c7>your selection determines which one activates.</>

<#72c8eb>SUPER ARTS</>
I. Grab Mode <#aab8c7>[1040]</>		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Grab Mode Follow-up		[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>After activation, use Punch at close range.</>
EX Grab Mode <#aab8c7>[1040]</>		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>Press two Punch buttons for the EX activation.</>

II. Energy Ball <#aab8c7>[880]</>		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>Punch strength changes the trajectory.</>
EX Energy Ball <#aab8c7>[2640]</>		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>Press two Punch buttons; requires three stocks.</>

III. Orbiting Stones <#aab8c7>[1120]</>		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
EX Orbiting Stones <#aab8c7>[1120]</>		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>Press two Punch buttons for the EX activation.</>
